# AGS Private Repo - .gitignore
# Only track dashboard + MD docs + CSV

# Ignore everything first
*

# Then whitelist what we want
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Dashboard files
!dashboard/
!dashboard/**

# AGS documentation
!AGS_*.md
!AGS_MASTER_OUTREACH.csv

# EXCLUDE sensitive financial files (keep local only, never push to public repo)
STRATEGY_RULES.md
AGS_CASH_FLOW_AUDIT.md

# Ignore build artifacts and temp files
*.py
*.ps1
*.zip
*.html
!dashboard/*.html
!dashboard/*.ps1
